  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "花bē tiâu枝"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>陳高登</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Ē記得十冬前我拄結婚，身軀邊不時就有人關心我「Tang時beh生囡仔？」我lóng喙笑目笑kā應講：「隨緣--lah！橫直iáu-koh少年！」參阮阿母mā開始tshuân一寡食補hōo--我，千交代萬交代：「Ài khah拍拚--leh--ōo！」M̄知是按怎，愈聽壓力愈大，本底無hiah-nī要意ê代誌，suah tsua̋n囥tī心肝頭。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span></span></p><a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阮翁ê khang-khuè tsiânn無閒，不sám時就ài去國外出張，阮翁仔某自結婚了後，無做伙蹛超過兩禮拜，所致，無法度生囡仔mā tsiânn正常。一日過一日，我ê腹肚lóng無消無息，tsit款隨緣ê態度，m̄-nā hōo阮阿母tsiok煩惱--ê，連ta-ke mā不時leh提醒ài好拍算--ah。序大人生成是為著古早ê觀念，認為「不孝有三，無後為大」，無囡仔beh按怎thn̂g後嗣？尤其是查某人——「好歹粿ài ē甜，好歹查某ài ē生」——bē生ê婦jîn人，親像就無價值--ah！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">總--是，緣份有一工也ē來。六冬前ê新正時，我發現家己有身--ah。Hit-tsūn，規厝間lóng歡喜kah，我mā總算ē-tàng穩心。M̄-koh，tsit个囡仔suah tsiah八週就無--去--ah。阮阿母講我是siunn lám身m̄-tsiah tsiú bē tiâu，tsua̋n tsiânn骨力kā我補身體，補kah我見若鼻著中藥味就píng腹。半冬khah ke，新ê緣份koh出現--ah！Tsit kái，我tsiânn細膩守護tsit个性命，不而過，想bē到三個月一下到，mā仝款koh無--去。Hit種失去希望ê痛苦、委屈kap怨tsheh，kan-na ē-tàng吞腹內……。自細漢，事事項項我to無hōo阿母操煩--過，獨獨tsit件代誌我有影是無才調。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">失望ê顛倒爿論真是希望。有一日，阮翁雄雄kā我講：「有囝有囝命，無囝天註定」，伊上ǹg望--ê，是我ē-tàng健康快樂，「顛倒無囡仔，lán ē-tàng做koh-khah濟有意義ê代誌」。有翁婿ê疼thàng kap體諒，hōo我ke真安心mā tsiânn感動，好佳哉伊無kā我看做是「豚母」，到tann lóng認真照顧我ê健康。雖bóng，「花bē tiâu枝」iáu是有淡薄仔遺憾，m̄-koh，tse m̄是樹欉ê過失，是花家己揀選ê結果；無開花suah健欉ê樹仔，猶原是tsit个世界不止仔美麗ê存在。</span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><span></span><span><!--more--></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjxFwFZ7iFhyphenhyphenlB3S9DvQGMCla1UUPANgR8YOc5HhJcxu7q3G6Ybg2Syq20R3sLZNJVROqm-yhcAqKqBYXGve-DNkJGIdJbiwRd7pxC0yZ1HVN3IkKqcnuEPTPuJhjv1McKUYCPqFTK1VkpozTork4MxpkDei-jU_tj6dDloosHhoSTdrARIZDFS0ooA-A_J/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1356%E6%9C%9F_%E9%BB%91%E7%99%BD%E5%85%A7%E9%A0%8148%E9%A0%8118.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjxFwFZ7iFhyphenhyphenlB3S9DvQGMCla1UUPANgR8YOc5HhJcxu7q3G6Ybg2Syq20R3sLZNJVROqm-yhcAqKqBYXGve-DNkJGIdJbiwRd7pxC0yZ1HVN3IkKqcnuEPTPuJhjv1McKUYCPqFTK1VkpozTork4MxpkDei-jU_tj6dDloosHhoSTdrARIZDFS0ooA-A_J/w453-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1356%E6%9C%9F_%E9%BB%91%E7%99%BD%E5%85%A7%E9%A0%8148%E9%A0%8118.jpg\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi7U4GBYB_pCwiPZOrWYlYs8wL5e_JXdpOTxq5_9GjF9Km078o0aIxOUYVHTWHaLRohYKhSvY2GHixi1Pa9jifjTWaLeBfEq2NvIYHJ_1EwG4qUQ87_FOaTJ6KTFZQZOm9smh_vvuvXuxoosd05BGz25-SzCDCdrXXJunfTup76kzou2GomGsqZeREn_o8H/s1424/356%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi7U4GBYB_pCwiPZOrWYlYs8wL5e_JXdpOTxq5_9GjF9Km078o0aIxOUYVHTWHaLRohYKhSvY2GHixi1Pa9jifjTWaLeBfEq2NvIYHJ_1EwG4qUQ87_FOaTJ6KTFZQZOm9smh_vvuvXuxoosd05BGz25-SzCDCdrXXJunfTup76kzou2GomGsqZeREn_o8H/w450-h640/356%E5%8F%B0%